{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Adjust Age vs Birth Date vs Incidence Date quality check so that a 1-year difference produces a Query (warning) rather than an Invalid (error) status across all registry modules and ad-hoc analysis\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Suppress holding database controls (\u8220"Move Into Main DB\u8221", \u8220"Delete Holding DB\u8221", \u8220"Select All Records\u8221") and Max Lines box in Ad-hoc mode\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Ensure all table progress bars (Patients, Tumours, Sources) and Overall progress end at 100% upon import completion even if table(s) are skipped\par}
